@startuml
title ML Project Architecture

skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<process>> #F0F7FF
  BackgroundColor<<dataset>> #F6FFF0
  BackgroundColor<<pipeline>> #FFF7F0
  BackgroundColor<<artifact>> #F3F0FF
  BorderColor #555555
}

package "Data Layer" {
  class Data <<datasets>> {

  }

  class FeatureTableCSV <<dataset>> {
   
  }

  class TrainedModel <<artifact>> {
   
  }
}

package "Preprocessing" {
  class Preprocessing <<process>> {

  }
}

package "Feature Engineering" {
  class FeatureEngineering <<process>> {

  }
}

package "Model Training" {
  class h2o_regression_pipeline2 <<pipeline>> {
 
  }
}

/' Data flow (left → right) '/
RawHistoricalFlights --> Preprocessing : reads
Preprocessing --> FeatureEngineering : cleaned data
FeatureEngineering --> FeatureTableCSV : writes CSV
FeatureTableCSV --> h2o_regression_pipeline2 : training input
h2o_regression_pipeline2 --> TrainedModel : saves


note right of FeatureEngineering
  Generates a single feature table
  used in training runs.
end note

note right of h2o_regression_pipeline2
  H2O regression pipeline:
  preprocessing inside H2O if needed,
  model training & selection,
  model persisted to Data Layer.
end note

legend left
  <<process>>   Processing step
  <<dataset>>   Data artifact / table
  <<pipeline>>  ML pipeline
  <<artifact>>  Saved model
end legend
@enduml
